# Atera

> Atera is an AI-powered, all-in-one IT management platform designed for enterprises, IT departments and MSPs. It combines Remote Monitoring & Management (RMM), Professional Services Automation (PSA), helpdesk ticketing, patch management, IT automation, remote access, and AI capabilities into a single, cloud-based solution. Atera uses a disruptive per-technician pricing model with unlimited endpoints, making it highly cost-effective at scale. Its flagship AI agent, Robin, autonomously resolves device and cloud issues end-to-end without technician involvement.

Atera serves two primary audiences: MSPs managing multiple client environments from a multi-tenant dashboard, and in-house IT departments managing single-organization infrastructure. The platform supports Windows, Mac, Linux, and VMware environments and includes a mobile app for on-the-go management.

## Homepage & Overview

- [Homepage](https://www.atera.com/): Main entry point introducing Atera's AI-powered IT platform, Robin AI agent, and core value proposition — all-in-one RMM, ticketing, and IT management priced per technician.

## Product Pages

- [Features Overview](https://www.atera.com/features/): Full overview of Atera's feature set including RMM, PSA, IT automation, patch management, scripting, remote access, network discovery, reporting, and integrations marketplace.
- [Robin — Autonomous AI Agent](https://www.atera.com/ai/robin/): Atera's patented AI agent that autonomously resolves device and cloud issues end-to-end for every employee. Captures requests, verifies users, diagnoses issues, executes approved actions, and closes the loop — no technician required.
- [AI Copilot](https://www.atera.com/ai/copilot/): AI-powered IT companion embedded in the platform. Provides real-time device diagnostics, ticket summarization, AI-recommended actions, script generation, and knowledge base article creation. Helps technicians work 10x faster.
- [Remote Monitoring & Management (RMM)](https://www.atera.com/products/rmm/): Real-time monitoring of all endpoints, servers, and networks. Includes threshold-based alerting, real-time dashboards, device health insights, and multi-OS support (Windows, Mac, Linux, VMware).
- [Patch Management](https://www.atera.com/products/patch-management/): Cloud-based automated patch management for operating systems and software. Includes advanced reporting, scheduling, and in-dashboard patch installation. Dashboard retains last-used filters for faster workflows.
- [Ticketing & Helpdesk](https://www.atera.com/products/ticketing/): Built-in service desk with ticket automation rules, SLA management, support addresses, email-to-case, time tracking, and customer portal. Supports approval workflows and end-user follow-up automation.
- [Network Discovery](https://www.atera.com/products/network-discovery/): Scans and monitors workgroup and domain controller networks to identify and list all assets. Provides status reports with device model, serial number, age, and replacement forecasting. Continuously updated.

## Solutions by Audience

- [Atera for MSPs](https://www.atera.com/msp/): Purpose-built solution for Managed Service Providers with multi-tenant dashboard, client billing module, contract management, SLA tracking, and per-technician pricing. Enables MSPs to manage unlimited client endpoints without per-device costs.
- [Atera for IT Departments](https://www.atera.com/it-department/): All-in-one IT management for internal IT teams. Focused on single-organization infrastructure management with department-level organization, site-based SLA management, and enterprise-grade security and compliance tools.

## AI Pages

- [AI Overview](https://www.atera.com/ai/): Central hub explaining Atera's AI strategy — from AI Copilot to Robin to IT Autopilot — and how Atera positions itself as the world's first AI-powered autonomous IT management platform.
- [Robin AI Agent](https://www.atera.com/ai/robin/): Patented autonomous AI agent resolving device and cloud issues end-to-end. Handles password resets, cloud actions, API integrations, and device fixes with full audit trails and governance controls. Proven to resolve 85% of help desk tickets.
- [AI Copilot](https://www.atera.com/ai/copilot/): Embedded AI assistant for technicians. Features include: ticket summarization, AI-suggested scripts, OID recommendations, terminal command generation, and knowledge base article drafting from ticket resolutions.
- [Savings Calculator](https://www.atera.com/ai/savings-calculator/): Interactive tool to estimate cost savings from deploying Robin. Shows potential reduction in technician time and ticket volume.
- [AI Security](https://www.atera.com/ai/security/): Overview of Atera's approach to AI security — covering data privacy, model governance, secure-by-design architecture, and compliance standards. Explains how Atera ensures customer and endpoint data is protected within its AI-powered features including Robin, AI Copilot, and IT Autopilot.

## Pricing Pages

- [MSP Pricing](https://www.atera.com/msp-pricing/): Per-technician pricing for MSPs. Four tiers: Pro ($129/mo/tech annually), Growth ($179/mo/tech), Power ($209/mo/tech), Superpower (custom). All plans include unlimited endpoints. 30-day free trial, no credit card required.
- [IT Department Pricing](https://www.atera.com/it-department-pricing/): Per-technician pricing for internal IT teams. Four tiers: Professional ($149/mo/tech annually), Expert ($229/mo/tech), Master ($269/mo/tech), Enterprise (custom). Unlimited endpoints on all plans.

